# The UOR-Foundation/MCP commit whose LexLean sources the gateway is built over, and
# the only place it is written (AGENTS.md R1). gateway/lay-out-mcp.sh lays out `src` and
# `language/mcp.core` of exactly this commit under gateway/mcp and gateway/language, and
# refuses any other. The gateway holds one production root over those modules and its
# tool layer (issue #7); it links no MCP crate.
#
# Development imports upstream commits; a release pins only upstream releases. This pin
# moves to the MCP release tag before lexlean-mcp v0.1.0.
#
# Currently: UOR-Foundation/MCP PR #40 (provider host effects as typed outcomes, MCP#39) at
# 601c967, which merges main with the input-required results (MCP#30) and exports the step root. The gateway needs the
# hook: `StepServe.serveStep` and `Refusal.ProviderRefusal.effectRequested`. The pin follows
# that branch until it is merged, then moves to the merge commit and later to the release tag.
